[en.FOCUS_C15_REVELATION]
The Revelation

[en.FOCUS_C15_REVELATION_desc]
“Obey the teachings of the Crystal Sacrament, and heed the Crystal Gospel.”\nRevised in the Crystal Sacrament, new prophecies are revealed, foretelling of natural disasters, wars, resistance against oppression, and impending doom. In the name of the Holy Crystal Heart, the Crystal Ponies are warned that only by closely following the path of Flurry Heart can they find salvation. After the followers endure their initial trials, the gates of heaven shall open wide to welcome them.

[en.FOCUS_C15_REVELATION_TOOLTIP]
We need at least §Y300§! seats to support us, currently we have: [?C15.C15_full_support|Y0].\nOr, we need to have more than §Y250§! seats ourselves, currently we have: [?C15.parliament_seat_array^1|Y0].

[zh.FOCUS_C15_REVELATION]
启示录

[zh.FOCUS_C15_REVELATION_desc]
“遵从圣章教诲，聆听水晶福音。”\n修订《水晶圣章》，新增有关天灾、战争、反抗压迫和毁灭的先知预兆；以神圣水晶之心的名义告诫水晶小马们，只有紧紧追随风雪之心，才是唯一的救赎之路。在追随者们经历过最初的劫难后，将会被天堂敞开大门欢迎。

[zh.FOCUS_C15_REVELATION_TOOLTIP]
我们需要至少 §Y300§! 席位的支持，目前的支持票：[?C15.C15_full_support|Y0]。\n或者，我们需要自身拥有超过 §Y250§! 席位，目前的席位：[?C15.parliament_seat_array^1|Y0]。

